    Frontend --> SDK
    MailCore --> SDK
    Control --> SDK
    Scanners --> SDK
    Workers --> SDK
    DeepAI --> SDK

    SDK --> Scrub --> Seg

    Postfix --> Collector
    Rspamd --> Collector
    ClamAV --> Collector
    Collector --> Scrub

    Compute --> CW
    LB --> CW
    DB --> CW
    Cache --> CW
    Storage --> CW
    Network --> CW

    Control --> Audit
    MailCore --> Outbox
    Workers --> Outbox
    Outbox --> SQS

    Note1[SegLumberjack is the app-observability backend]
    Note2[CloudWatch is complementary AWS infrastructure telemetry]
    Note3[Audit and DB/outbox remain authoritative records]

    Seg -.-> Note1
    CW -.-> Note2
    Audit -.-> Note3
